<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title || 'Download Edutrack Apps' %></title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #10231c;
            --muted: #62756d;
            --green: #06996b;
            --green-deep: #037252;
            --green-dark: #064f3d;
            --green-soft: #eaf8f2;
            --line: #d7e6df;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --soft: #f5faf8;
            --danger: #df3f3f;
            --shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.18);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        a { color: inherit; }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
            min-height: 100svh;
            color: #ffffff;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18) 0 126px, transparent 128px),
                radial-gradient(circle at 24% 42%, rgba(77, 255, 186, 0.16), transparent 310px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #08ad78 0%, #078a62 52%, #045c42 100%);
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: -12vw;
            right: -12vw;
            bottom: -176px;
            height: 332px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
            transform: rotate(3.2deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 18px 34px rgba(6, 114, 82, 0.08);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .wrap {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .brand-bar {
            min-height: 88px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .brand img {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 3px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(5, 79, 61, 0.22);
        }

        .brand strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .brand span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 1fr;
            gap: clamp(42px, 6vw, 86px);
            align-items: center;
            padding: 14px 0 150px;
        }

        .phone-shell {
            position: relative;
            width: min(286px, 92vw);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 39px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(145deg, #ff9d1f 0%, #f47b12 42%, #c04700 72%, #7a2100 100%);
            box-shadow:
                0 38px 96px rgba(4, 55, 42, 0.28),
                0 18px 56px rgba(174, 73, 0, 0.34),
                inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 184, 78, 0.88),
                inset 0 0 0 5px rgba(29, 15, 8, 0.88);
        }

        .phone-shell::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            z-index: 5;
            top: 14px;
            left: 50%;
            width: 86px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #0c1512;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }

        .phone-shell::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: -3px;
            top: 116px;
            width: 4px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #b13a00;
            box-shadow: inset 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 173, 69, 0.55);
        }

        .phone-screen {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid #17110c;
            border-radius: 31px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 14%, rgba(8, 133, 95, 0.08), transparent 130px),
                #f4faf7;
            height: 552px;
        }

        .phone-header {
            padding: 39px 12px 9px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            color: var(--ink);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2ece7;
        }

        .phone-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .phone-brand img {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 2px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(6, 114, 82, 0.14);
        }

        .phone-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .phone-subtitle {
            margin-top: 2px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .phone-chip-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 9px;
        }

        .phone-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            min-height: 25px;
            padding: 0 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #f4faf7;
            border: 1px solid #dcebe4;
            color: var(--green-dark);
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .live-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ff3f3f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(255, 63, 63, 0.16);
        }

        .phone-body {
            flex: 1;
            min-height: 0;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .greeting-card,
        .analytics-card,
        .weekly-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.08);
        }

        .greeting-card {
            padding: 11px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .greeting-card small {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .greeting-card strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: #121c18;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .stat-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .compact-stat {
            min-height: 56px;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #dcebe4;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f6faf8;
        }

        .compact-icon {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            background: #e3f8ef;
            position: relative;
        }

        .compact-icon.present::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            left: 6px;
            top: 4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--green);
        }

        .compact-icon.present::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 13px;
            height: 6px;
            left: 4px;
            bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 3px 3px;
            background: var(--green);
        }

        .compact-icon.absent {
            background: #fff0f0;
        }

        .compact-icon.absent::before,
        .compact-icon.absent::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 3px;
            left: 4px;
            top: 9px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--danger);
        }

        .compact-icon.absent::before { transform: rotate(45deg); }
        .compact-icon.absent::after { transform: rotate(-45deg); }

        .compact-stat b {
            display: block;
            color: #071a14;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .compact-stat span {
            color: #53665f;
            display: block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .analytics-card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.86fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .ring {
            width: 84px;
            height: 84px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: conic-gradient(#0aa16f 0 var(--rate), #d7f2e7 var(--rate) 100%);
        }

        .ring span {
            width: 62px;
            height: 62px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #071a14;
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .analytics-copy strong {
            display: block;
            color: #101b16;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.08;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .analytics-copy span {
            display: block;
            color: #34463f;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .rate-line {
            margin-top: 7px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
            color: #2d3e37;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .rate-track {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            height: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #dcebe4;
        }

        .rate-track i {
            display: block;
            width: var(--rate);
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: inherit;
            background: var(--green);
        }

        .weekly-card {
            padding: 11px;
        }

        .weekly-title {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .weekly-title small {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 9px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .bars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 4px;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .day {
            min-height: 56px;
            display: grid;
            justify-items: center;
            align-items: end;
            padding: 5px 3px;
            border-radius: 11px;
            background: #f7faf8;
            color: #53665f;
            font-size: 8px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .day i {
            width: 18px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #e94646;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .day:nth-child(1) i { height: 25px; }
        .day:nth-child(2) i { height: 31px; }
        .day:nth-child(3) i { height: 23px; }
        .day:nth-child(4) i { height: 34px; }
        .day:nth-child(5) i { height: 27px; }

        .phone-nav {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 2px;
            padding: 6px 9px 9px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2ece7;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
        }

        .phone-nav span {
            text-align: center;
            color: #5e7069;
            font-size: 7px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .phone-nav b {
            display: block;
            width: 22px;
            height: 19px;
            margin: 0 auto 3px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #edf7f3;
            color: #087a59;
            position: relative;
        }

        .phone-nav b::before,
        .phone-nav b::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            background: #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .home::before {
            width: 13px;
            height: 10px;
            left: 6px;
            bottom: 5px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .phone-nav .home::after {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            left: 7px;
            top: 4px;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .phone-nav .attendance::before {
            width: 13px;
            height: 15px;
            left: 7px;
            top: 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .attendance::after {
            width: 9px;
            height: 2px;
            left: 9px;
            top: 11px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .schools::before {
            width: 15px;
            height: 9px;
            left: 6px;
            top: 6px;
            transform: skewY(-24deg);
        }

        .phone-nav .schools::after {
            width: 13px;
            height: 5px;
            left: 7px;
            bottom: 5px;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }

        .phone-nav .report::before {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            left: 6px;
            top: 5px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .report::after {
            width: 2px;
            height: 8px;
            left: 10px;
            bottom: 6px;
            box-shadow: 4px -3px 0 #087a59, 8px 1px 0 #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .alerts::before {
            width: 12px;
            height: 13px;
            left: 7px;
            top: 5px;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 4px 4px;
        }

        .phone-nav .alerts::after {
            width: 6px;
            height: 2px;
            left: 10px;
            bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .hero-copy {
            max-width: 700px;
            padding-top: 0;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 34px;
            padding: 0 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both, softPulse 2.8s ease-in-out infinite 0.8s;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 20px 0 14px;
            max-width: 720px;
            font-size: clamp(38px, 3.8vw, 56px);
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            text-wrap: balance;
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.1s both;
        }

        .lead {
            max-width: 680px;
            margin: 0 0 24px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.93);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.62;
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.2s both;
        }

        .lead span {
            display: block;
        }

        .lead span + span {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .download-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.3s both;
        }

        .store-button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-height: 54px;
            padding: 0 28px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #0f1f19;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(6, 79, 61, 0.26);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, background 180ms ease;
        }

        .store-button.secondary {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .store-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 42px rgba(6, 79, 61, 0.3);
        }

        .store-button.ios-coming {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            color: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .store-button.disabled {
            pointer-events: none;
            background: #80968e;
            color: #eef7f3;
        }

        .status {
            margin-top: 18px;
            max-width: 620px;
            color: <%= apkAvailable ? "#dbfff0" : "#ffe1e1" %>;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 16px rgba(3, 88, 63, 0.42);
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.4s both;
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
            margin: 72px auto 74px;
        }

        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(18px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes softPulse {
            0%, 100% {
                box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), 0 0 0 rgba(94, 255, 195, 0);
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.24), 0 0 26px rgba(94, 255, 195, 0.2);
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
            }
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 660px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            margin: 0 0 9px;
            font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .section-title p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .app-card {
            min-height: 238px;
            padding: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.08);
        }

        .app-card .icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--green-soft);
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .app-card .icon::before,
        .app-card .icon::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            background: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .mobile-icon::before {
            width: 18px;
            height: 27px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 3px solid var(--green-deep);
        }

        .mobile-icon::after {
            width: 6px;
            height: 2px;
            bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .desktop-icon::before {
            width: 27px;
            height: 18px;
            top: 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 3px solid var(--green-deep);
        }

        .desktop-icon::after {
            width: 22px;
            height: 3px;
            bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .browser-icon::before {
            width: 28px;
            height: 22px;
            top: 13px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 3px solid var(--green-deep);
        }

        .browser-icon::after {
            width: 22px;
            height: 3px;
            top: 20px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .app-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .app-card p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.55;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .card-link {
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .desktop-note {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        @media (max-width: 940px) {
            .hero-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 30px;
                padding-top: 10px;
                padding-bottom: 140px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .hero-copy {
                margin: 0 auto;
                order: -1;
                padding-top: 0;
            }

            .lead, h1 { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
            .download-row { justify-content: center; }
            .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .wrap, .content { width: min(100% - 26px, 1120px); }
            .brand-bar { min-height: 68px; }
            .brand span { white-space: normal; }
            .hero::before { bottom: -132px; height: 264px; }
            .hero-grid { padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 112px; }
            h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 11vw, 46px); }
            .lead { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
            .store-button { width: 100%; }
            .phone-shell { width: min(274px, 100%); }
            .phone-screen { height: 532px; }
            .content { margin-top: 46px; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 390px) {
            .phone-shell { width: min(264px, 100%); }
            .phone-screen { height: 516px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <% const safeStats = stats || {}; %>
    <% const totalStudents = safeStats.totalStudents || 0; %>
    <% const presentToday = safeStats.presentToday || 0; %>
    <% const attendanceRate = totalStudents ? Math.min(100, Math.round((presentToday / Math.max(totalStudents, 1)) * 100)) : 0; %>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="brand-bar">
                <a class="brand" href="/app" aria-label="Open Edutrack">
                    <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="Edutrack Logo">
                    <span>
                        <strong>Edutrack</strong>
                        <span>Schools Division of Sipalay City</span>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="phone-shell" aria-label="Edutrack mobile dashboard preview">
                    <div class="phone-screen">
                        <div class="phone-header">
                            <div class="phone-brand">
                                <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="phone-title">Edutrack</div>
                                    <div class="phone-subtitle">Schools Division of Sipalay City</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="phone-chip-row">
                                <span class="phone-chip"><i class="live-dot"></i>LIVE</span>
                                <span class="phone-chip">Fri, May 29</span>
                                <span class="phone-chip"><%= safeStats.today || '' %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="phone-body">
                            <div class="greeting-card">
                                <small>Good morning</small>
                                <strong>Juan Dela Cruz</strong>
                                <small>Friday, May 29, 2026</small>
                                <div class="stat-row">
                                    <div class="compact-stat"><i class="compact-icon present"></i><b><%= totalStudents %></b><span>Students</span></div>
                                    <div class="compact-stat"><i class="compact-icon present"></i><b><%= presentToday %></b><span>Present</span></div>
                                    <div class="compact-stat"><i class="compact-icon absent"></i><b><%= safeStats.absentToday || 0 %></b><span>Absent</span></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="analytics-card">
                                <div class="ring" style="--rate:<%= attendanceRate %>%"><span><%= attendanceRate %>%</span></div>
                                <div class="analytics-copy">
                                    <strong>Today Analytics</strong>
                                    <span><%= presentToday %> of <%= totalStudents %> students present</span>
                                    <div class="rate-line">
                                        <span>Live rate</span>
                                        <span><%= attendanceRate %>%</span>
                                        <div class="rate-track" style="--rate:<%= attendanceRate %>%"><i></i></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span style="margin-top:10px;color:#7a8b84;"><%= safeStats.absentToday || 0 %> student absent</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="weekly-card">
                                <div class="weekly-title">
                                    Weekly Absence Analytics
                                    <small>Absent students per day (Mon-Fri)</small>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bars">
                                    <span class="day">Mon<i>1</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Tue<i>2</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Wed<i>1</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Thu<i>3</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Fri<i>1</i></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="phone-nav">
                            <span><b class="home"></b>Home</span>
                            <span><b class="attendance"></b>Attendance</span>
                            <span><b class="schools"></b>Schools</span>
                            <span><b class="report"></b>Report</span>
                            <span><b class="alerts"></b>Alerts</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span>Live Edutrack Platform</div>
                    <h1>Access Attendance Monitoring Anytime, Anywhere</h1>
                    <p class="lead">
                        <span>Stay connected with real-time attendance records, student monitoring, absence alerts, reports, school information, and adviser communication tools through the Edutrack platform.</span>
                        <span>Access the same synchronized data across the web platform, Android devices, and iOS devices through a secure cloud-based system.</span>
                    </p>
                    <div class="download-row">
                        <a class="store-button <%= apkAvailable ? '' : 'disabled' %>" href="/download/mobile-app" download>
                            Download Android App
                        </a>
                        <a class="store-button ios-coming" href="/download/ios-app" download title="Download the Edutrack iOS app package when available.">
                            Download iOS App
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status">
                        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                            <%= error %>
                        <% } else if (apkAvailable) { %>
                            Android and iOS applications are available for secure and real-time attendance monitoring.
                        <% } else { %>
                            Android app package is being prepared for secure and real-time attendance monitoring.
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main id="apps" class="content">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Choose Your Edutrack App</h2>
            <p>Use the same account and same Railway-hosted database whether you open Edutrack on mobile, desktop, or the browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
            <article class="app-card">
                <div class="icon mobile-icon"></div>
                <h3>Mobile App</h3>
                <p>Install the latest mobile app package for dashboards, alerts, school lists, reports, and native adviser contact actions.</p>
                <a class="card-link <%= apkAvailable ? '' : 'disabled' %>" href="/download/mobile-app" download>Download mobile app</a>
            </article>
            <article class="app-card">
                <div class="icon desktop-icon"></div>
                <h3>Desktop App</h3>
                <p>Download the Windows launcher to open Edutrack as a focused desktop window using the same secure web system.</p>
                <a class="card-link" href="/download/desktop-app" download>Download desktop app</a>
                <div class="desktop-note">Works best with Microsoft Edge or Google Chrome.</div>
            </article>
            <article class="app-card">
                <div class="icon browser-icon"></div>
                <h3>Browser Install</h3>
                <p>Supported desktop browsers can install Edutrack as a standalone app with the same account and live database.</p>
                <button class="card-link" type="button" data-install-desktop style="border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;cursor:pointer;">Install from browser</button>
            </article>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        let deferredInstallPrompt = null;
        const installButtons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-install-desktop]');

        window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt', (event) => {
            event.preventDefault();
            deferredInstallPrompt = event;
        });

        installButtons.forEach((button) => {
            button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
                if (!deferredInstallPrompt) {
                    window.location.href = '/download/desktop-app';
                    return;
                }
                deferredInstallPrompt.prompt();
                await deferredInstallPrompt.userChoice;
                deferredInstallPrompt = null;
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
